      : d.new_live.on ? `<strong>Test mode, new enquiries live</strong> (since ${new Date(d.new_live.since).toLocaleString('en-NZ', { day: 'numeric', month: 'short', hour: 'numeric', minute: '2-digit' })}): new enquirers get their emails; everyone else’s come to you.`
      : '<strong>Test mode:</strong> every client email comes to you, marked with who it was for.';
